    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Discord</h1><p><br>Have any suggestions or ideas?</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Huge Circuits!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Build - </strong> Place many logic gates in a voxel world, the only limit is your imagination.<br></li><li><strong>Connect - </strong> Use connect mode to link logic gates together with non-physical wires. Use various connect tools to speed up the process!<br></li><li><strong>Test - </strong> Simulate your Circuits by using inputs and outputs, with many features to control the tick speed.<br></li><li><strong>Integrated Circuits! - </strong> Combine your huge circuits into a custom block with the press of a button.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cool Upcoming Features</h2>LogiCircuit is unique 3D Circuit Simulator where you can play with your friends in Multiplayer, play in a Tutorial/Campaign mode, and more!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Huge Circuits!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Build - </strong> Place many logic gates in a voxel world, the only limit is your imagination.<br></li><li><strong>Connect - </strong> Use connect mode to link logic gates together with non-physical wires. Use various connect tools to speed up the process!<br></li><li><strong>Test - </strong> Simulate your Circuits by using inputs and outputs, with many features to control the tick speed.<br></li><li><strong>Integrated Circuits! - </strong> Combine your huge circuits into a custom block with the press of a button.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cool Upcoming Features</h2>LogiCircuit is unique 3D Circuit Simulator where you can play with your friends in Multiplayer, play in a Tutorial/Campaign mode, and more!",
    "short_description": "LogiCircuit is the next generation of circuit building! Use various logic gates and integrated circuits to simulate real life computers, games, programs, and more!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
